      <p begin="00:04:24.976" end="00:04:28.668"><span begin="00:04:24.976" end="00:04:25.181">让</span><span begin="00:04:25.181" end="00:04:25.632">你</span><span begin="00:04:25.632" end="00:04:25.866">如</span><span begin="00:04:25.866" end="00:04:26.227">同</span><span begin="00:04:26.227" end="00:04:27.000">王</span><span begin="00:04:27.000" end="00:04:28.668">后</span></p>
    </div>
  </body>
</tt>